{
 "id": "romeo-vo-01",
 "own_branch": true,
 "model_prefs": [
  "eleven_v4"
 ],
 "words": true,
 "items": [
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_A_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[curious, warm] 罗密欧，为朱丽叶哭呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sniffling, completely blank] ...Who is Juliet?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[sobbing dramatically] Rosaline! She hath forsworn to love!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[eager, still sniffling] Good friend, bear her this!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[firm, matter-of-fact] 我只拍，不插手。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_B_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[whispers] 为了罗瑟琳，混进仇家舞会。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[awestruck, breathless] Did my heart love till now?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[innocently curious] 那罗瑟琳呢？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[distracted, not listening] Who?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[teasing, friendly] 朱丽叶，看上谁了？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[urgent, bossy] Go ask his name.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat, polite but firm] 我只拍。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[whispers] 他是她家世仇的独子。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_C_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[sighing, dreamy] O Romeo, Romeo! Wherefore art thou Romeo?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[whispers] 对方哪里好？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[whispering, then bursting out] It is the east, and Juliet is the sun!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[whispers, deadpan] 现在是半夜。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[softly, dreamy] My bounty is as boundless as the sea, my love as deep.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[deadpan, teasing] 才认识三小时吧？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[primly, very serious] It is too rash, too unadvised, too sudden.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[lovesick sigh] Romeo... Romeo...",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[earnest, hand on heart] Lady, by yonder blessed moon I swear—",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[cutting in, quick] O, swear not by the moon, the inconstant moon!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[brisk, decisive] Thy purpose marriage, send me word tomorrow!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[instantly, thrilled] At the hour of nine!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_D_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[dry, knowing] Wast thou with Rosaline?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[stiffly] I have forgot that name.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[wry, amused] Young men's love then lies not truly in their hearts, but in their eyes.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[amused, surprised] 那这婚您还证？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[slow, wise] Wisely and slow; they stumble that run fast.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[quietly, ominous] These violent delights have violent ends.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_E_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[quietly, uneasy] 罗密欧？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[hollow, shaken] O, I am fortune's fool!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[whispers, shaken] 他刚杀了朱丽叶的表哥。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_F_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[whispers] 爸妈要她后天嫁别人。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[low, careful] Take thou this vial. No warmth, no breath, shall testify thou livest.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[low, reassuring] Two and forty hours, and then awake as from a pleasant sleep.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[fierce, impatient] Give me, give me! O, tell not me of fear!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[worried] 罗密欧知道吗？",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[busy, writing] Shall Romeo by my letters know our drift.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[gently, hopeful] Thou. Wilt thou bear this to Romeo?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "34c483aaa9f266050bb548d8a3495b18c266f138401947fae23df13770cb6f7b",
      "voice_id": "0lp4RIz96WD1RUtvEu3Q",
      "name": "Grandfather"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[small, hesitant] ……我只拍。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[softly, brave] Romeo, I come! This do I drink to thee.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_G_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[whispers] 先到的消息：朱丽叶死了。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[raw, defiant] Then I defy you, stars!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[desperate hope] Hast thou no letters to me from the friar?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[barely audible] ……没有。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[flat, empty] No matter.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[urgent, cut off] 等等，她没——",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[whispers, voice cracking] 她没死。他没听完。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_H_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[soft, wondering] Death hath had no power yet upon thy beauty.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[tender, quiet] Beauty's ensign yet is crimson in thy lips and in thy cheeks.",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[desperate, voice shaking] 红的，是因为她活着！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[calm, tender] Here's to my love!",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[breaking] 我只拍，不插……[shouting] 不拍了！",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "dlg_I_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[waking, drowsy, soft] Where is my Romeo?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[puzzled] Did the friar's letter not reach thee?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "76c9cb1aa5bde66e61587de2b16dd92ca167852393360a9c1f7e567f229a31b4",
      "voice_id": "rCmVtv8cYU60uhlsOo1M",
      "name": "Ana"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[blank] What letter?",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "[tiny, sheepish] ……拍不了了。我送。",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "8ef98e23c1198e4a1eddd0480344160e4f2dce44147dfc18c034756c42071e4a",
      "voice_id": "I23uc91tu5zY2PA1tKEN",
      "name": "Lin"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "dialogue",
   "name": "also_C08_s1597",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "seed": 1597,
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5
   },
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "[lovesick sigh] Juliet... Juliet...",
     "voice": {
      "owner": "89befade7c13aab22ca8c36dfb1892f659fd750058462eeed6b05ab238204d74",
      "voice_id": "kmSVBPu7loj4ayNinwWM",
      "name": "Archie"
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}